# Google API key used for restaurant search and location autocomplete
# (Places API New — Text Search + Autocomplete). Create a key at
# https://console.cloud.google.com/ and enable the "Places API (New)".
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key. Without one, the app falls back
# to a bundled demo deck (and location autocomplete is disabled).
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
